# Normalise text to LF in the repository and in every working tree, whatever a
# contributor's core.autocrlf says. A Windows checkout must not rewrite sources:
# the rules build and its parsers are asserted against LF, and CI checks out the
# Windows legs with core.autocrlf=true on purpose to prove it.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
